CONTENT: I see! `parse_input` processes all frames in the input buffer in a loop (line 976). So if both DATA frame 2 (with END_STREAM) and DATA frame 3 (after END_STREAM) are in the buffer at the same time, they would both be processed in the same `on_read` call.

